# The other direction, and the round trip that shows nothing was lost on the
# way. A line as wide as the grid folds into a grid half as wide, and then the
# grid it started at unfolds it back onto one row — which is the screen this
# pins. A fold that dropped the tail leaves a short line here.
out "abcdefghijklmnopqrst"
resize 10 4 8 16
resize 20 2 8 16
